DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270202
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270203
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-002: Receive and count the day cases arrive (by T-5 at 
 the latest) (you)
DESCRIPTION:Receive and count the day cases arrive (by T-5 at the latest):
  count against the packing list\, best-by at least 60 days after T\, lot n
 umbers\, damage\; photograph the cases. Reject what fails and tell the bra
 nd the same day. Check the allergen line on the card text word for word ag
 ainst a package in your hand. Short shipment (the campaign's checks say "r
 eceived X of Y due"): reduce units per office evenly (units_override)\, lo
 g a short_shipment issue and tell the brand the same day.\nLog it in: inve
 ntory: received (lot\, best_by)\, rejected\; approvals: units_override\; i
 ssues
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
