SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-002: Courier (you)
DESCRIPTION:Courier: confirm the booking and send the route sheet (make_ro
 ute.py). Send building certificates ahead to the buildings that require th
 em\, and attach the same PDFs to the courier's booking email (the route sh
 eet tells the courier they are there). Tell the courier where cases taken 
 back go: the receiving address\, the same day.\nLog it in: drops: courier_
 or_van
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
