DESCRIPTION:Drop day\, 8 to 11 am: route in order\; 'on my way' 20 minutes
  out (template 05)\; the per-stop procedure on the route sheet. Courier: y
 ou meet the courier at every first-drop office. Log everything the same da
 y: the delivered count is the route sheet's 'handed over' count (founder_c
 ount or courier_count)\; an office that declined at the door gets no deliv
 ered row.\nLog it in: stops: arrival\, departure\, handed_to_role\, outcom
 e\; inventory: delivered\; photos\; counts: placed\; issues\; hours: drop_
 day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
