DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270210
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270211
SUMMARY:SAMPLE-DRP-002: Placement confirmation to each brand (template 06)
  (you)
DESCRIPTION:Placement confirmation to each brand (template 06): the office
 s placed by today\, each with its photo. Office not placed by today\, or t
 urned away at the door: credit note row and refund or take it off the bala
 nce ($120 founding\, $150 standard)\; the campaign's checks say "credit du
 e from T+1" until the credit notes cover it. Standard: issue the balance i
 nvoice today.\nLog it in: invoices: credit_note\, standard_balance
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
